      "body": "I deleted a conversation that I could not archive or unpin. It has been sitting in my window for several weeks. I previously deleted the conversation in the past and this deleted the entire worktree, but I got the bright idea to try it again because no matter what I do I couldn't get rid of the conversation stuck in my pinned convos (Archive and unpin doesn't work. It comes back when restarting)\n\nSo as soon as I selected delete conversation, my entire worktree folder was empty. Everything is gone. All of the untracked configs, .env files and so on are all gone. I cannot restore them using another clone. \n\nJust wanted to point this out if it isn't on the radar. Deleting a conversation should NOT delete the entire worktree. ",
